This is almost comically aligned with Algorand's own suggested category: their challenge explicitly says to build paid endpoints for **“trust scores, proofs, audit trails, reputation checks, or validation services.”** ([Algorand][2])

Their judging is equally weighted across real payment volume, use-case quality, sustained potential and innovation; x402 has to be core rather than cosmetic. 

